BALANCE PHILOSOPHY & POINT SYSTEM (PP)
- Dmg: 1 PP per 3 dmg (single); 1 PP per 2 dmg (AoE).
- Block: 1 PP per 4 Block.
- Draw: 1 PP per 1 card drawn/searched/tutored.
- Discard: 0.5 PP (utility cost).
- Status: 1 PP minor (Poison1/Chill1); 2 PP major (Stun1/Regen2); +0.5 PP per extra turn.
- Utility: 1 PP minor (Slow1); 2 PP steal; 3 PP skip/AoE control.
- Synergy/Wheel Amp: +2 PP (rare+).
- Multi-Hit/Pierce: +0.5 PP per extra.
- Sustain: 1 PP per 2 Regen/heal.
- Mod per L/Pt: +0.5 PP.
- Exhaust Keyword: -1 Budget (anti-recycle penalty).
- Budget Formula: [(Energy Cost × 3) + (Min Cascade Spend × 2) + Type Adj] × Rarity Mult - Penalties (e.g., Exhaust -1).
  - Type Adj: Chain +2; Dual +1; Transmute/Shift -1; Finisher +4.
  - Rarity Mult: Common ×1; Rare ×1.2; Epic ×1.5; Legendary ×2.5 (stronger for cost; ignore minor caps).
  - Cap: Total PP ≤ Budget (round down).

RARITY GUIDELINES
- Common: Basic, efficient, no amps. Max 4/deck.
- Rare: +1 mod (e.g., +status/L). Max 4/deck.
- Epic: Wheel synergies, hybrids. Max 4/deck.
- Legendary: Unique/powerful (e.g., auto-synergy, high util). Max 1/deck; achievement/story rewards only.

