HOW TO CALCULATE & GENERATE A CARD
1. Choose Type/Rarity/Element (e.g., Epic Transmute, Storm).
2. Set Costs/Reqs (e.g., 2E, Min3, Refund3, Exhaust).
3. Calc Budget: (2×3) + (3×2) -1 -1(Exhaust) = 10 ×1.5(Epic)=15 PP.
4. Build Effects: E.g., Draw2 (2 PP) + Shock1 AoE (3 PP) + 4 dmg×spent (4 PP)=9 PP. Fits—add mod for rarity.
5. Check: No overlap (e.g., common version weaker/no AoE). Legendary: Pump to 25 PP same costs.
6. Keywords: Draw (top X/add to hand); Search (tutor specific to hand/top); Discard (random/targeted); Exhaust (post-play remove).

BALANCE MANDATES
- 1/3 AoE, 1/4 control, 1/5 sustain.
- Multi-Viability: 30–40% Duals/Shifts/Draw.
- Power Curve: L3=15–30, L5=40–70, L7=70–120 (Leg +50%).
- Expansion: Plug into formula; playtest PP tweaks.